(And of course "Why not?" could be seen as just as appropriate and simple.  But not as funny, in our opinion)

@Sean 
From my perspective, half the clues were trick free. What was tricky about URL starter or civil rights icon Parks? What could they be other than HTTP and ROSA? Babe in the Hundred Acre Wood? __ the Explorer??

Maybe stick with Sunday through Wednesday. If those get boring, try the Thursday pool again. I find the water here to be quite lovely. For more challenge but fewer tricks, Friday and Saturday are great options.

